---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';

import {site} from '../config/site';
---
<Layout title="Medical disclaimer" description={`Information is a starting point. Read the ${site.shortName} demonstration website’s medical disclaimer.`}><PageIntro title="Information is a starting point." eyebrow="Medical disclaimer" items={[{name:'Medical disclaimer'}]}/><section class="section container" style="padding-top:0"><div class="rich-copy"><h2>General education only</h2><p>The treatment pages and journal explain general possibilities and considerations. They do not replace examination, diagnosis, informed consent or advice from your own qualified healthcare professional.</p><h2>Individual suitability & outcomes</h2><p>Every procedure carries risk. Suitability depends on medical history, anatomy, skin characteristics, medicines and other factors. Outcomes, recovery times and longevity vary. No result, medication or prescription is guaranteed.</p><h2>Products, devices & claims</h2><p>FDA approval or clearance applies to a particular product, device and indication, not to a practice as a whole. Use outside a labeled indication requires a qualified clinician’s judgment and appropriate consent. Ask which product or device is proposed and why.</p><h2>Urgent symptoms</h2><p>This website and its forms are not emergency services. For severe pain, breathing difficulty, vision changes, sudden weakness or another emergency, call 911 or seek immediate medical attention. Do not wait for an online response.</p><h2>Fictional profiles & imagery</h2><p>All {site.shortName} clinicians and testimonials are fictional. Stock photography depicts models and environments. Comparison sliders use illustrative color changes to a single image and must not be interpreted as clinical results.</p><p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href="/contact">Contact the team ↗</a></p></div></section></Layout>
